This directory contains code from python-for-android
(https://github.com/kivy/python-for-android), at the revision recorded in
P4A_VENDOR.toml, distributed under the MIT License in LICENSE.

The files here are unchanged copies. kivyforge's Android bootstrap also carries
python-for-android members inside its own PythonActivity.java, each between
"// BEGIN p4a <name>" and "// END p4a <name>" markers; P4A_VENDOR.toml lists
them, and they are likewise unchanged.

kivyforge's own code, including where it adapts these to its bootstrap, lives
outside this directory and outside those markers.
